---
import BlogLayout from '../layouts/BlogLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/content';
---
<BlogLayout title="Privacy" description="What erengun.dev collects: nothing. No cookies, analytics or trackers." path="/privacy/">
  <p class="eyebrow"><span class="g">&gt;</span> Last updated November 2026</p>
  <h1 class="display">Privacy</h1>
  <div class="page-copy">
    <p>This site sets no cookies and runs no analytics or trackers.</p>
    <p>The only third-party requests are Google Fonts (Space Grotesk, IBM Plex Mono) and GIPHY, for the embedded GIFs in one blog post. Everything else, including the 3D scenes and images, is served from erengun.dev on GitHub Pages, which keeps standard server logs.</p>
    <p>If your device asks for motion and orientation access, that data stays in your browser: it only tilts the scenes and is never stored or sent anywhere.</p>
    <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
  </div>
</BlogLayout>

<style>
  .page-copy { display: grid; gap: 1.1rem; max-width: 38rem; font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #d8d8d8; }
  .page-copy a { color: var(--ice); text-underline-offset: .2em; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }
</style>
